Fixes to portable_tensorflow_lib_lite (the mobile build of TF core), which
has bit-rotted at this TensorFlow revision:

1. It depends on //tensorflow/core/util:onednn_env_vars, a oneDNN/MKL helper
   whose deps unconditionally include the full //tensorflow/core:framework.
   Linking the portable lib on Android therefore also links
   framework_internal_impl, and every symbol both provide is duplicated.
   oneDNN is x86-only and tf_mkl_kernel_library compiles no sources in
   mobile builds, so the dependency is dead weight there; drop it.

2. Its own sources include tsl/platform/protobuf.h, which at this revision
   unconditionally includes full-protobuf util headers (older TF guarded
   them for lite-proto builds), but the target does not put the protobuf
   headers on its include path; add the dependency.

3. Its quantization sources reach xla/tsl/concurrency/executor.h, which is
   not in its declared dependency closure; add the header-only target.

4. xla/tsl/platform/file_system.h -- which is in the mobile header set, and
   which the mobile sources include -- includes xla/tsl/platform/status_macros.h,
   which is not. That header in turn includes absl/status/status_macros.h.
   Neither is declared, so compiling xla/tsl/platform/default/unbounded_work_queue.cc
   for Android fails:

     undeclared inclusion(s) in rule
     '@@org_tensorflow//tensorflow/core:portable_tensorflow_lib_lite':
       'external/xla/xla/tsl/platform/status_macros.h'
       'external/com_google_absl/absl/status/status_macros.h'
       'external/com_google_absl/absl/status/status_builder.h'
       'external/com_google_absl/absl/strings/internal/stringify_stream.h'

   Add status_macros.h to the mobile header filegroup next to status.h and
   statusor.h, and depend on @com_google_absl//absl/status:status_macros,
   whose own deps cover the remaining two headers. This surfaced only with
   the Abseil that LiteRT 2.2.0's TensorFlow pins, which is where
   absl/status:status_macros first appears.

diff --git a/tensorflow/core/BUILD b/tensorflow/core/BUILD
--- a/tensorflow/core/BUILD
+++ b/tensorflow/core/BUILD
@@ -1086,7 +1086,9 @@
         "//tensorflow/core:mobile_additional_lib_deps",
         "//tensorflow/core/platform:resource",
         "//tensorflow/core/public:release_version",
-        "//tensorflow/core/util:onednn_env_vars",
         "//tensorflow/core/util:stats_calculator_portable",
         "@xla//xla/tsl/util:safe_reinterpret_cast",
+        "@com_google_absl//absl/status:status_macros",
+        "@com_google_protobuf//:protobuf",
+        "@xla//xla/tsl/concurrency:executor",
     ] + tf_portable_proto_lib() + tf_portable_deps_no_runtime(),
diff --git a/third_party/xla/xla/tsl/platform/BUILD b/third_party/xla/xla/tsl/platform/BUILD
--- a/third_party/xla/xla/tsl/platform/BUILD
+++ b/third_party/xla/xla/tsl/platform/BUILD
@@ -201,7 +201,8 @@
         "prefetch.h",
         "ram_file_system.h",
         "resource.h",
         "status.h",
+        "status_macros.h",
         "statusor.h",
         "threadpool.h",
         "threadpool_interface.h",
